- ## perihelion
+ ## perihelion

- - `perihelion.Websocket.Error.Reason.Truncated` now renders as "the connection closed before the
-   frame was complete"; its `Communicable` instance previously had no case for it, so describing
-   such an error threw a `MatchError`. (#2439)
+ - `perihelion.Websocket.Error.Reason.Truncated` wird jetzt als „the connection closed before the
+   frame was complete“ dargestellt; seine `Communicable`-Instanz hatte zuvor keinen Fall dafür,
+   sodass das Beschreiben eines solchen Fehlers einen `MatchError` warf. (#2439)

